# Keep the repository limited to source, documentation, and text/config files.
*
!*/
# Ignore local AI/editor metadata that should stay on this machine and never be pushed upstream.
.kilo/
.vscode/
.idea/
.aider/
.claude/
.copilot/
.cursor/

!.gitignore
!LICENSE*
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.py
!*.ps1
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.bat
!*.csv

# Explicitly keep generated/binary GrandOrgue and recording data out of Git.
*.orgue
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mid
*.midi
*.cache
*.idx
*.cmb
*.zip